    "Cost": 1906009,
    "UIName": "Mauler",
    "Id": "chassisdef_mauler_MAL-1PT6",
    "Name": "Mauler",
    "Details": "The MAL-1PT6 was one of two early variants of the Mauler produced during the initial design and testing phases. Armed with two Large Lasers, two LRM-15 and four AC/2 meant the 'Mech was somewhat successful at handling engagements at most medium to long distances.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Distracting</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.18</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
